1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,744
Three sentences with if.

2
00:00:01,744 --> 00:00:05,898
If it rains, the match will be cancelled: that may well happen.

3
00:00:05,898 --> 00:00:11,966
If I were you, I would apologise: I am not you, so it is unreal.

4
00:00:11,966 --> 00:00:17,643
If she had revised, she would have passed: it is over, and it did not happen.

